<title>USA: BAB Holdings calls off acquisition plan.</title>
<headline>BAB Holdings calls off acquisition plan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc, citing maket conditions, said Tuesday it would not proceed with plans to acquire the assets of the privately held companies that own and operate Chesapeake Bagel Bakery, a bagel chain based in McLean, Va.</p>
<p>BAB said it was unable to secure necessary financing to proceed with the transactions prior to the expiration date of the agreement.</p>
<p>BAB operates Big Apple Bagels.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
